on but communication issues. A has anticipation and leadership but unfriendly.\n\nProbably B is strongest overall if crew issues can be mitigated? But concerns are significant for safety-critical role. D also has concerns. C's egocentric may be problematic. A's unfriendly may affect crew.\n\nMaybe we need to ask for more info on reliability for each candidate? Or ask about any observed reliability evidence for candidates? Could ask Agent1 or 2 about reliability observations. But we need to contribute now: maybe share my private notes about Candidate C's concern for others and attention, and compare with B's stress handling. Provide provisional recommendation leaning towards Candidate B, but note crew cooperation concerns need addressing.\n\nThus public message: share observation about C's attention and concern for others, compare with B's stress resilience, note concerns about B's crew cooperation from Agent1, and propose we need more info on crew cooperation for all. Vote maybe B provisional.\n\nLet's output."}
